    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The “One payment. Two very different answers.” framing is strong, and the signed-intent versus paid-cart mismatch culminating in ALLOW/BLOCK creates a clear demo story. However, the dominant visual remains a familiar dark cybersecurity dashboard: event table, status pills, monospace labels, and a detail panel. The causal evidence is relegated to small text, so no singular visual mechanism becomes iconic across viewports.",
